  "question": {
    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>∀</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>y</mi></msup></math> (where,&nbsp;<math><mi>c</mi></math> is an arbitrary constant). Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>λ</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>2</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>4</mn></math>",
